    "Bd3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Place the bishop on d3, NOT c4. On c4 it would be vulnerable to the pawn thrust b5 and to being hit by the pieces; on d3 it reinforces the centre and stays safe, giving White a free hand on both wings.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Develop the bishop where it supports the centre and dodges b5 — d3 over c4 here.",
   "plans": "Castle, keep the centre, and play on both sides."
